{"id":"664538","name":"莴笋干炒腊肠","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/664538/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莴笋干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腊肠","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青红椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一把莴笋干放进水里泡软。","img":"images/664538/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净，挤干水分备用。","img":"images/664538/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱姜切粒，腊肠切片，青红椒切段（我是库存冷冻的）","img":"images/664538/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里倒油烧热，下入辣椒，姜蒜爆香。","img":"images/664538/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入莴笋干翻炒。","img":"images/664538/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，盐，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/664538/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腊肠是熟的，最后放进去炒软。","img":"images/664538/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅前加一点松茸鲜。","img":"images/664538/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"莴笋干炒腊肠。","img":"images/664538/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"香香辣辣，口感又脆，特别下饭。","img":"images/664538/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}